  DisplayName: A Durbar Is Proclaimed in Delhi
  EventType: 1
  Description: The princes of India {are assembling|will assemble} at Delhi for a
    durbar of great splendour. The papers {print|will print} engravings of jewelled
    arms and embroidered hangings, and collectors at home {want|will want} pieces
    of their own. Agents in Bombay {are sending|will send} what they can.
